abstract: >
  An integrated desktop workflow for designing, generating, inspecting and
  validating analytic tokamak grids for BOUT++. The Grid Suite combines an
  interactive poloidal cross-section designer with analytic and custom-boundary 
  axisymmetric grid generation, NetCDF output, automated geometry and metric 
  diagnostics, magnetic-field checks, visualisation, and structured diagnostic 
  reporting for controlled simulation studies, numerical testing, and reproducible
  BOUT++ workflows.
